commercial at

	<character> "@".  {ASCII} code 64.  Common names: at sign, at,
	strudel.  Rare: each, vortex, whorl, {INTERCAL}: whirlpool,
	cyclone, snail, ape, cat, rose, cabbage, amphora.  {ITU-T}:
